    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The TS = 0 yields the same choices when S and T are interchanged in the above equation. The Hamiltonians in this case are of the form (3.8)."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
