    "bounding box" : [ 101.265, 270.043, 524.625, 316.18 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "All of the above SUSY realizations are algebraic or independent of the size of the representation of the SUSY algebra. For the C2 representation the SUSY generators take the form"
