    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "It is clear that these matrices perform a Z2-grading of the Hilbert space C2, with b and f projecting to the ‘bosonic’ and ‘fermionic’ parts of C2. It is also important to note that the C2 representation of SUSY (3.16) span the space of operators acting on C2,"
